SDV aebsc:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP 5ms+/-0ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 1ms +/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP 5ms +/-0ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 1ms+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP 5ms +/-0ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 1ms+/-0ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (period 5ms+/-0ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, AD 1ms+/-0ms)    
    Actuator Signal Alarm (trigger on event, AD 1ms+/-0ms)
App :
    Component Data_hub :
        Signal Detection_data
        Signal Reaction_data
        Service Fuse_detection:
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            publish to Detection_data
            period 5ms+/-0ms offset 0ms+/-0ms
            execution 1ms+/-0ms 
    Component AEB_controler :
        Signal Processed_detection
        Service Compute_detection:
            subscribe to Detection_data
            publish to Processed_detection
            trigger on Detection_data
            execution 1ms+/-0ms
        Service Compute_reaction:
            subscribe to Processed_detection
            publish to VSS signal Alarm
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            trigger on Processed_detection
            execution 1ms+/-0ms

Functional Chains:
    chain :
    Camera -> 
    Fuse_detection ->
    Compute_detection ->
    Compute_reaction ->
    Brake